# CAUGHT-NOT: = AreMembersUnchanged
# CAUGHT: Return
# A row whose last answer is handed on as a value.
# RUN(VALUED): walk f8
# VALUED: = FindsDeclaredMember {{*}}key="read" conditions=[{layout=L1 key="read"}, {layout=L1 key="name"}] receivers=[L1]
# VALUED-NOT: = FindsDeclaredMember
