# AWAITED: = FindsDeclaredMember {{*}}key="name"
# Two classes: the names of each by one guard, the two guards by one count.
# RUN(PAIR): walk f16
# PAIR: = FindsDeclaredMember {{*}}key="read" conditions=[{layout=L1 key="read"}, {layout=L2 key="read"}, {layout=L1 key="name"}, {layout=L2 key="name"}] receivers=[L1, L2]
# PAIR-NOT: = AreMembersUnchanged
# PAIR-NOT: = FindsDeclaredMember
# PAIR: Return
# The heir lays a `step` of its own: the receivers of the second question are fewer: no row.
# RUN(MIXED): walk f17
